b037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂咏 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"寂寞何人问，韶颜镜里红。\n亦知年未老，无意向东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11767,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潍亭逢王子作二绝 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"汝从秣陵来，还向秣陵去。\n惆怅不忍离，邻鸡酒中曙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11768,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潍亭逢王子作二绝 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"系榜潍亭柳，呼樽且啸歌。\n罢官应不悔，湖海酒船多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11769,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐荆州过余兄弟不肯饮而留连金金吾许夕拜所走笔戏之","author":"王世贞","text":"自掷双鱼后，难将五马留。\n祇应金许宅，一榻为南州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11770,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏为乩仙语","author":"王世贞","text":"昨夜蕊珠宫，冰壶弄秋月。\n不肯玉床眠，鞭龙醉中发。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11771,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"调张助甫三绝 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"宦薄无劳问，居然张长公。\n何如掷手板，一棹五湖东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11772,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"调张助甫三绝 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"何限青山色，当君对案时。\n肯同山吏部，长醉习家池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11773,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"调张助甫三绝 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"迁客真难作，看人眼亦劳。\n为言名士业，饮酒读离骚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11774,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日抱痾十二绝句 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"支枕时自言，斯人有斯疾。\n老作一蠹鱼，残编送馀日。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11775,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日抱痾十二绝句 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"传闻三峡下，白雪捲青天。\n借得东邻水，潺湲亦可怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11776,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日抱痾十二绝句 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"偶然片语出，却拾寰中遗。\n歌罢还自赏，安用他人为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11777,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日抱痾十二绝句 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"晓梦钟欲残，故人枕边别。\n武夷山上云，白雪楼中雪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11778,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日抱痾十二绝句 其五","author":"王世贞","text":"虽揽千古书，畏语千古事。\n白日稍向西，一事一垂泪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11779,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日抱痾十二绝句 其六","author":"王世贞","text":"病在何妨暑，科头镇日眠。\n莫言疏笔砚，不索卖文钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11780,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日抱痾十二绝句 其七","author":"王世贞","text":"世事久不闻，偶传北来耗。\n远志在东山，一夕俱小草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11781,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日抱痾十二绝句 其八","author":"王世贞","text":"西林贝叶编，东林竹叶酒。\n问我西来意，翻云醉中有。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11782,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日抱痾十二绝句 其九","author":"王世贞","text":"客有携枰者，湛思入玄解。\n忽悟敛子时，人我俱安在。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11783,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日抱痾十二绝句 其十","author":"王世贞","text":"客是华阳馆，仍云霅上来。\n野夫名已尽，只爱自衔杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11784,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日抱痾十二绝句 其十一","author":"王世贞","text":"社酒乡人至，无言但一卮。\n犹胜莫处士，强我坐谈诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11785,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日抱痾十二绝句 其十二","author":"王世贞","text":"长卿故倦游，藜床壁间挂。\n但唤尤老来，青山随意写。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11786,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]